  "description": "NVDA is the \"sector leader\" for the entire market...why you should be cautious",
  "body_html": "<p>When <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$NVDA&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> goes up, the broader market goes up. When Nvidia crashes, so does the rest of the market. This post is not a prediction of what Nvidia will do at earnings…we have clearly demonstrated that earnings are always a coin toss or a gamble. Personally, I <em><strong>typically</strong></em> avoid earnings unless I am up more than 30%. Earnings are an excellent catalyst, up or down, and NVDA has earnings tomorrow 27 August, post-market. </p><p>The primary point of the video: Whether you are in NVDA or not, monitor their earnings. If they break to the upside, great! If they break to the down side, no worries, we will start looking for more short positions like we did in January and February. All big market crashes are preceded by a small market crash. Do not let your portfolio ride into a big market crash: respect ALL of the small ones. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lGpp!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb04a47e7-6ee7-4870-8c43-e4390505ccf3_900x895.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lGpp!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb04a47e7-6ee7-4870-8c43-e4390505ccf3_900x895.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lGpp!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb04a47e7-6ee7-4870-8c43-e4390505ccf3_900x895.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lGpp!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb04a47e7-6ee7-4870-8c43-e4390505ccf3_900x895.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lGpp!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb04a47e7-6ee7-4870-8c43-e4390505ccf3_900x895.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lGpp!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb04a47e7-6ee7-4870-8c43-e4390505ccf3_900x895.jpeg\" width=\"900\" height=\"895\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b04a47e7-6ee7-4870-8c43-e4390505ccf3_900x895.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:895,&quot;width&quot;:900,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Nvidia Becomes the World's Most Valuable Company.&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Nvidia Becomes the World's Most Valuable Company.\" title=\"Nvidia Becomes the World's Most Valuable Company.\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lGpp!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb04a47e7-6ee7-4870-8c43-e4390505ccf3_900x895.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lGpp!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb04a47e7-6ee7-4870-8c43-e4390505ccf3_900x895.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lGpp!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb04a47e7-6ee7-4870-8c43-e4390505ccf3_900x895.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lGpp!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb04a47e7-6ee7-4870-8c43-e4390505ccf3_900x895.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Though a meme, there is a lot of sad truth to this.</figcaption></figure></div><p>We will see what happens tomorrow. You all generally want my speculation…so take it with a grain of salt…</p><ul><li><p>If today and tomorrow broader market + NVDA slightly declines, NVDA earnings will move to the upside. </p></li><li><p>If today and tomorrow broader marker + NVDA rises, NVDA earnings move to the downside. </p></li></ul><p>Again…just speculation. I believe that we are still on track for the blow off top…nothing has “snapped” and the VIX remains within investable territory. However, though I have remained bullish…begrudgingly…do not get comfortable. The melt up clearly happened, the blow off top is likely to happen (IMO)…the melt down has NOT went away. Look at the volume on NVDA. Huge declines under rising prices. This spells catastrophe. Its not if, its when. Don’t get caught in the fallout, whenever it comes. Take pull backs seriously, all of them.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wjbS!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F30bc6eb4-1a17-4ef4-a8f0-67e7fe181bfc_1504x765.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wjbS!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F30bc6eb4-1a17-4ef4-a8f0-67e7fe181bfc_1504x765.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wjbS!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F30bc6eb4-1a17-4ef4-a8f0-67e7fe181bfc_1504x765.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wjbS!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F30bc6eb4-1a17-4ef4-a8f0-67e7fe181bfc_1504x765.pn