0-67e7fe181bfc_1504x765.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wjbS!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F30bc6eb4-1a17-4ef4-a8f0-67e7fe181bfc_1504x765.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">The entire market is held up by this bubble. Note the declining volume since 2001 to today, with rising prices. This is a great example of a melt up event…and melt ups always end with meltdowns. </figcaption></figure></div><p> At the end of the day, you do what is best for you. These are just my thoughts, opinions and forecasts. You are welcome to contact a financial advisor, where more than 90% of them underperform the market and make a living from “management” fees (no judgement if this is you…its a great business model!) You are welcome to ping me in the chat anytime during market hours. </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://www.stocktokdashboard.com/\">StockTokDashboard</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-weekly-wrap-up-822?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjozMDEwNTIzMjUsInBvc3RfaWQiOjE3MTY1NTcwMCwiaWF0IjoxNzU2MTQ2MDYxLCJleHAiOjE3NTg3MzgwNjEsImlzcyI6InB1Yi0zNTM3ODIyIiwic3ViIjoicG9zdC1yZWFjdGlvbiJ9.Dy1ckHX5d6yCVwBd130HXA_5sXvfIVHuUcvkDNfFxRc&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">If you like StockTok’s analysis and commentary, share it with someone you like. Heck, share it with people you don’t like to!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/nvidia-earnings-warning?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/nvidia-earnings-warning?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat